WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Zinger

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.520
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.520
and the events shown are fiction.

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:21.630
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:26.100
It's a real miracle for us

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:28.900
that after every day there comes tomorrow.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.840
It's dangerous. There may be another explosion.

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:36.180
Your Majesty!

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:38.810
No. You can't go there.

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:41.550
Your Majesty!

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.880
-Your Majesty!
-Protect the king.

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.350
Your Majesty!

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:50.320
Your Majesty, we need to leave.

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:52.490
-Your Majesty!
-Hurry up.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.900
No. We need to save him!

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.040
-Your Majesty.
-Don't go there.

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.440
Don't interfere.

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.780
What are you saying? King...

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.210
Listen to me!

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:14.310
I'll explain everything to you later.

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.480
Now save yourself.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:18.480
-Your Majesty!
-It's dangerous here

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:20.020
take the queen to Daejojeon.

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.390
-Your Majesty, don't go there.
-Your Majesty.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:25.990
-Let me in!
-Your Majesty.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:27.690
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.460
Let me in, please.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:31.800
Let me go!

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:32.970
Let me in!

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:34.000
Your Majesty!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.040
However

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.740
we don't understand how wonderful it is,

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:43.340
until the day comes that has no tomorrow.

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:48.050
We are so stupid that we don’t value something

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:50.680
until we lose it.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:57.420
Tomorrow never comes

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.330
Episode 13

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:18.750
Someone dared to make an attempt on the king's life in the palace.

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:22.120
Catch all suspicious persons and interrogate them.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.150
We have to find out

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.190
who is behind this?

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:31.320
Have you prepared this?

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:35.330
How are you going to deal with the consequences after planning something like this?

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:36.800
Calm down.

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:39.130
As if I could calm down!

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.900
The king's life was threatened in front of everyone,

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.900
and so on display.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:48.810
So, everything has been decided
that I made an attempt on his life?

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.580
I'll take care of it.

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:03.020
I beg you. I pray.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.490
I desperately pray to the gods of heaven and earth.

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:12.730
Save our king.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:17.000
I beg you. I pray.

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:19.570
I beg you.

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:24.410
Save

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.720
our king.

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:36.590
I didn't know they would go this far.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:39.760
They themselves placed him on the throne,

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:42.430
and now they want to get rid of him.

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:48.100
What happens if the king doesn't wake up?

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:55.020
Then the royal concubine and I will be powerless.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:00.880
I can't believe we got it right

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.420
into a trap set for the queen.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:06.820
I beg you. I pray.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:10.120
I beg you.

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:16.200
Get some rest.

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.870
You will fall so soon.

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:25.610
If the king doesn't survive,

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.940
I won't be able to live either.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:34.010
If you have to die,

00:06:34.850 --> 00:06:38.950
Before death I will take revenge on the king’s offender.

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:41.720
Palace

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.390
and those people

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:50.660
made us angry.

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:27.970
Your Majesty. The head of the Detective Department came.

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:31.640
And Cheoljong...

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.740
Is the king okay?

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:39.510
Prince Yeonpyeong prohibited

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:41.550
enter Hijeongjon while the king is being treated.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:45.280
And nothing is said about the king's condition.

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:47.250
I have to go to him.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.490
Don't go.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.790
They'll let me in.

00:07:53.790 --> 00:07:55.260
I'm still his wife.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.120
Don't go.

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:26.960
He made an attempt on your life.

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:30.260
You have every right to kill him.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:39.340
Soyeon.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:52.750
I need to rest.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.040
Are you sure there won't be any problems?

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.040
Certainly.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.440
Who was behind this?

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:24.040
We are innocent.

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:27.550
We are ready to give our lives to protect the king.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:29.920
We are the royal guard.

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:38.290
Why do you need fake documents?

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:41.390
You used this excuse to detain us,

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:44.600
and at this time the king suffered.

00:10:45.230 --> 00:10:46.500
Behind this is the one

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:49.740
who found errors in our documents. Your father

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.540
Kim Jwageun!

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:55.310
This is Kim Jwageun.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:58.710
You're pretty smart.

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:06.450
I have everything figured out.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:15.700
As you thought, the incense burner was not filled with sand,

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:17.600
and gunpowder used as explosives.

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:19.370
How did you guess?

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:29.110
How did it go?

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:31.240
It is not easy to force them to confess.

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:32.510
Without a doubt.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.580
Did you find out anything else?

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.520
Not yet.

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:39.350
We need to find the criminals to put an end to this.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.650
Find the instigator as soon as possible.

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:42.720
Yes.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.300
Find out where the gunpowder comes from.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.300
Move quietly and alone.

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:54.670
Yes.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:05.750
Mister.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:08.910
Please forgive me.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.750
What are you doing? Too many eyes.

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:14.520
I beg you.

00:12:14.690 --> 00:12:16.360
Listen to me.

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:20.190
It won't take much time. Just a little.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.830
Please. Not for long.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.400
I'm just in case

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:30.470
kept the ledger.

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:35.170
I never even thought of using it.

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:39.110
Besides, the queen knew nothing about it.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:40.980
Where is the ledger now?

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:49.290
Isn't she in your possession?

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:52.220
Then she can only be

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.490
at the king's.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.160
How so.

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:03.340
The traces you left have put our clan in danger.

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:05.740
This is enough to punish you.

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.440
I'll do whatever you say.

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:09.940
If you tell me to die, I will die.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:16.080
Right here.

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:21.420
I'll hang myself right here.

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:26.860
I'm hanging myself.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:35.730
Spare me, sir.

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:40.110
Spare me.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:52.180
Your Majesty.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:55.590
Your Majesty, have you come to your senses?

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:58.890
My brother.

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:01.390
Yes. Continue.

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.500
Why is it so noisy here?

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.500
It's so noisy it gives me a headache.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:12.810
I can't hear anything.

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:16.940
Turn down the noise.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.490
I had to explain.

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:40.170
I should have told him that the king did not try to kill me.

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:45.170
He made an attempt on your life.

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:47.870
You have every right to kill him.

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:54.850
You will have to pay for your recklessness.

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:57.880
Is the Kim clan behind this?

00:14:59.820 --> 00:15:01.050
Or another clan?

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:04.460
Your Majesty.

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:09.060
Your Majesty. The king came to his senses.

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:34.020
He seems to have woken up.

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:37.420
He just fell asleep.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.030
Why did you wrap him up like that?

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.440
Looks too sick.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:55.810
Unfortunately,

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:59.550
The explosion caused him to lose his hearing.

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.180
Just don't say

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:09.250
that he would be deaf for the rest of his life.

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:12.460
Only time will tell.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.210
Leave us alone.

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:31.780
Yes.

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.770
Will you say again that this is not the work of your family?

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:56.970
You told me

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.210
that I will lose someone dear to my heart.

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:04.640
Now in my heart

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:08.280
there is no one left.

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:13.850
That's why I ask

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:16.760
stop it.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:39.650
Your Majesty, stop worrying.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:04.870
Who...

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:09.640
My king, are you awake?

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:12.610
Let me wet your lips.

00:18:23.890 --> 00:18:25.860
Queen's Dictionary

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:56.020
So you went to visit the king.

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:05.400
I came to console you after what happened

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.100
and ask a few questions.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.940
Your father has lost an important thing.

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:16.280
I'm sure the king took her secretly.

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:18.880
Do you know anything about this?

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.480
- I got it, I’m going for help.
-No.

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:25.780
No one should know that I...

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:29.020
What am I...

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:34.860
So you know something.

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:37.900
Remember how I said

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.730
that our kind has no weaknesses?

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:42.970
Because we immediately get rid of them.

00:19:52.180 --> 00:19:55.080
Let me ask you one last time.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:58.720
Is there anything you want to tell me?

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:02.890
When we were in my house

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:07.130
I saved the king when he fell into the well.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:09.660
Maybe it was then...

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:18.770
Some time ago I made you an offer.

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:21.440
The day you fell into the lake.

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:26.680
Let me remind you.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:30.580
I asked you to keep an eye on your husband.

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:33.090
you will accept

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:36.760
my suggestion?

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:50.740
And what will I get in return?

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:52.840
What do you want?

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:56.480
Guarantees of my safety.

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:18.400
Your Highness, it's time for you to return.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.210
Queen's Dictionary

00:21:58.270 --> 00:21:59.940
I shouldn't have gotten here
Jang Bong-hwan

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:14.190
Cheoljong.

00:22:15.150 --> 00:22:16.250
Sorry.

00:22:17.660 --> 00:22:19.320
You'll still lose.

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:23.430
I'm on the winning side.

00:22:30.940 --> 00:22:34.410
Kim Soyeon, you still said goodbye to life.

00:22:36.170 --> 00:22:38.010
Since I already had the chance to take your place,

00:22:38.780 --> 00:22:40.980
let me live this life well.

00:22:43.280 --> 00:22:45.180
In order for this to succeed, I need to find out

00:22:45.880 --> 00:22:47.220
what happened that day.

00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:50.150
Someday you too will lose

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:52.780
person dear to you.

00:23:54.020 --> 00:23:56.120
You must love me.

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:58.160
Is this an order?

00:24:03.100 --> 00:24:05.900
There is nothing real about me, everything is a lie.

00:24:07.400 --> 00:24:09.330
You are Soyeon.

00:24:16.210 --> 00:24:18.780
Have you taken this position yourself?

00:24:19.480 --> 00:24:21.850
If you want to die, die in the palace.

00:24:23.180 --> 00:24:25.920
Tomorrow you will become queen.

00:24:35.660 --> 00:24:38.400
Tomorrow you will become queen.

00:24:38.530 --> 00:24:39.600
From now on

00:24:40.430 --> 00:24:43.840
tell me everything about him.

00:24:43.970 --> 00:24:46.340
Ask me

00:24:47.870 --> 00:24:49.240
keep an eye on the king?

00:24:49.540 --> 00:24:52.510
Don't follow the king
and not take your eyes off your husband.

00:24:57.180 --> 00:24:58.320
Don't want.

00:25:00.850 --> 00:25:03.890
Don't you want queen status

00:25:03.890 --> 00:25:05.760
and the king?

00:25:06.590 --> 00:25:09.930
You must do what you were born to do.

00:25:12.360 --> 00:25:14.800
How they did it in the past.

00:25:20.110 --> 00:25:23.110
When they told me that the king was in the well.

00:25:28.650 --> 00:25:31.580
If you don't do your part,

00:25:31.820 --> 00:25:35.220
the king is useless. From useless

00:25:36.150 --> 00:25:37.920
need to get rid of it.

00:25:39.190 --> 00:25:40.960
If you harm the king,

00:25:41.760 --> 00:25:43.400
I won't stand by.

00:25:43.400 --> 00:25:45.660
So what will you do?

00:25:46.300 --> 00:25:48.400
You are very mistaken.

00:25:48.700 --> 00:25:52.370
Do you think the queen has power?

00:25:52.900 --> 00:25:58.410
The queen is only needed for
production of heirs.

00:26:00.110 --> 00:26:02.410
If you become queen

00:26:02.410 --> 00:26:04.250
What kind of power do you think you will have?

00:26:05.350 --> 00:26:08.120
like a simple woman?

00:26:53.500 --> 00:26:55.530
This is not just because of Kim Jwageun's words.

00:26:57.470 --> 00:26:59.770
Even after staying in the palace for a short time,

00:27:00.970 --> 00:27:03.680
I've experienced enough to realize reality.

00:27:10.080 --> 00:27:11.880
The whole palace

00:27:13.820 --> 00:27:15.750
killed Kim Seo-yeon.

00:27:22.920 --> 00:27:24.020
Your Majesty.

00:27:25.990 --> 00:27:27.060
Your Majesty.

00:27:28.590 --> 00:27:29.590
Your Majesty.

00:27:33.530 --> 00:27:35.630
Your Majesty, Your Majesty!

00:27:37.170 --> 00:27:39.570
Queen, what are you doing here so late?

00:27:41.670 --> 00:27:44.910
Why are you soaked through?

00:27:45.980 --> 00:27:49.410
Did they really fall into the lake again?

00:27:52.080 --> 00:27:53.650
Why do you keep doing this?

00:27:54.320 --> 00:27:56.890
Now you must gather your strength.

00:27:56.890 --> 00:28:00.590
Otherwise, why have I tried so hard until now?

00:28:01.430 --> 00:28:05.360
Why did I have to go through such humiliation?

00:28:05.360 --> 00:28:07.230
Why do you need this?

00:28:08.230 --> 00:28:10.600
For your own profit
to fill your storehouses.

00:28:11.640 --> 00:28:14.510
You sold your daughter out of greed.

00:28:15.170 --> 00:28:17.410
-Soyeon.
-Why did you always ask me?

00:28:17.410 --> 00:28:19.710
become a queen, the pride of the family?

00:28:20.180 --> 00:28:23.110
Why did they say that once I became queen, I could do whatever I wanted?

00:28:23.850 --> 00:28:26.990
Why should I, suffering from guilt for the death of my mother,

00:28:26.990 --> 00:28:29.990
did you inspire your dreams?

00:28:31.720 --> 00:28:35.090
Do you even know what I was thinking when I jumped into the lake?

00:28:35.890 --> 00:28:38.730
The life I thought was mine was a lie.

00:28:40.100 --> 00:28:42.570
Even the dreams were not mine.

00:28:43.740 --> 00:28:45.800
I'm a complete failure.

00:28:48.510 --> 00:28:50.680
That's why I ran away.

00:28:52.910 --> 00:28:53.950
What?

00:28:56.350 --> 00:28:58.150
On the day your dream came true,

00:28:59.350 --> 00:29:01.950
I lost the most dear person.

00:29:03.190 --> 00:29:04.960
Myself.

00:29:05.760 --> 00:29:08.590
It was you who pushed me into this lake.

00:29:33.690 --> 00:29:36.190
It is convenient for children to blame their parents for everything.

00:29:37.320 --> 00:29:39.220
There was no need to blame my father.

00:29:53.640 --> 00:29:54.710
Your Majesty.

00:30:04.380 --> 00:30:06.120
I have to say something.

00:30:08.120 --> 00:30:10.460
I know that you will do anything for me.

00:30:11.260 --> 00:30:14.030
That is, I found out.

00:30:14.030 --> 00:30:15.530
My memories have returned.

00:30:23.100 --> 00:30:24.670
Don't do anything else.

00:30:25.240 --> 00:30:28.740
If you're worried about me, don't do anything.

00:30:29.810 --> 00:30:31.340
This is the only thing that will help me.

00:30:33.210 --> 00:30:34.280
Soyeon.

00:30:36.210 --> 00:30:37.720
Don't call me by name.

00:30:38.850 --> 00:30:40.190
I just

00:30:41.220 --> 00:30:43.620
the queen, whom the Detective Department serves.

00:30:58.300 --> 00:31:00.740
Queen's Dictionary

00:31:12.720 --> 00:31:14.650
arrow, lotto, special forces, kitchen police, ramen

00:31:14.650 --> 00:31:16.120
Social distancing

00:31:25.130 --> 00:31:27.270
means every man for himself.

00:31:27.270 --> 00:31:29.370
showdown, jasmine tea, bad manners.

00:31:49.690 --> 00:31:52.090
I'll tell the truth since you can't hear me.

00:31:54.690 --> 00:31:56.660
I decided to live a long life.

00:32:00.900 --> 00:32:02.370
I will betray you.

00:32:04.170 --> 00:32:06.370
I choose the path that will save my life.

00:32:08.810 --> 00:32:10.140
And don't die.

00:32:11.140 --> 00:32:12.910
Recover as if nothing happened.

00:32:15.910 --> 00:32:17.380
And then I can stab you in the back.

00:32:56.520 --> 00:32:57.890
You were right.

00:32:58.760 --> 00:33:01.090
The king was stronger than he showed.

00:33:02.090 --> 00:33:03.390
I regret this.

00:33:03.390 --> 00:33:05.930
What do you think about today's case?

00:33:06.730 --> 00:33:08.900
We found gunpowder at the explosion site.

00:33:09.070 --> 00:33:10.700
-Powder?
-Yes.

00:33:11.240 --> 00:33:13.340
There are two types of gunpowder in Joseon.

00:33:13.540 --> 00:33:15.570
The one delivered from the Qing Empire.

00:33:16.010 --> 00:33:18.210
And a local one from the gunpowder warehouse.

00:33:18.580 --> 00:33:20.510
They have a slight difference in structure.

00:33:20.750 --> 00:33:24.120
The one we found is local.

00:33:24.320 --> 00:33:27.350
The powder magazine is part of the weapons room.

00:33:28.690 --> 00:33:31.460
And the armory room is in charge of the Minister of War.

00:33:32.360 --> 00:33:34.160
He is my father's right hand.

00:33:36.190 --> 00:33:37.460
This means...

00:33:42.470 --> 00:33:45.540
My father was the one who brought the king to the throne.

00:33:46.370 --> 00:33:47.970
The king showed his true colors

00:33:47.970 --> 00:33:49.940
his father wants to eliminate him,
until it became his mistake,

00:33:49.940 --> 00:33:52.740
and field guards with fake
individuals responsible for the explosion.

00:33:53.040 --> 00:33:54.810
This must be his plan.

00:33:54.810 --> 00:33:58.220
When was the last time you came to me,
you wanted something.

00:34:00.050 --> 00:34:01.720
So what do you want?

00:34:02.220 --> 00:34:04.090
I want

00:34:07.460 --> 00:34:08.760
king.

00:34:17.840 --> 00:34:19.640
I can't stop now.

00:34:20.870 --> 00:34:22.810
And if that's how you feel, Soyeon,

00:34:24.180 --> 00:34:25.280
this is another reason.

00:34:47.070 --> 00:34:50.230
I came here to tell you about
what did the queen do yesterday?

00:34:51.500 --> 00:34:55.110
She saved the feast
which was bound to fail.

00:34:55.810 --> 00:34:58.410
Do you think I'll believe you?

00:34:58.910 --> 00:35:01.050
You probably think

00:35:01.050 --> 00:35:03.180
It was I who caused the incident with the king.

00:35:03.180 --> 00:35:05.250
If you check, you will easily find the answer.

00:35:05.880 --> 00:35:09.120
As I understand it, you wanted to ruin the feast.

00:35:09.450 --> 00:35:11.520
Even if the queen is stripped of her title...

00:35:11.520 --> 00:35:13.460
I don't need any titles.

00:35:14.030 --> 00:35:18.000
I just want the queen
disappeared from the king's sight.

00:35:19.330 --> 00:35:20.600
This means

00:35:21.900 --> 00:35:24.270
that the king likes the queen.

00:36:36.940 --> 00:36:39.480
By the looks of it, you had a hard time.

00:36:40.510 --> 00:36:42.810
Are you that worried about the king?

00:36:44.320 --> 00:36:45.350
God.

00:36:46.380 --> 00:36:48.220
He only recently became your son-in-law.

00:36:48.620 --> 00:36:50.460
You seem to have become attached to him.

00:36:50.660 --> 00:36:51.720
Well,

00:36:54.130 --> 00:36:55.230
to be honest,

00:36:55.960 --> 00:36:59.260
I did something
which will dishonor our family.

00:37:00.630 --> 00:37:03.470
I kept records illegally
acquired property of our family.

00:37:05.100 --> 00:37:06.640
And I lost them.

00:37:07.270 --> 00:37:08.340
What?

00:37:08.340 --> 00:37:10.140
I found out where the book is now.

00:37:10.510 --> 00:37:12.710
I just need to find her and get rid of her.

00:37:13.610 --> 00:37:16.610
But I ask you to spare the queen.

00:37:17.920 --> 00:37:20.280
Why did you suddenly mention her?

00:37:20.280 --> 00:37:21.620
The man who now has the book

00:37:23.220 --> 00:37:24.490
this is the king.

00:37:26.420 --> 00:37:29.330
The Queen has no
attitude towards this situation.

00:37:29.690 --> 00:37:33.060
The king misled her and me.

00:37:35.970 --> 00:37:38.540
Yes, he misled everyone.

00:37:38.770 --> 00:37:42.010
I will accept any punishment you give me.

00:37:43.110 --> 00:37:44.180
But

00:37:46.310 --> 00:37:47.650
Have mercy Soyeon.

00:37:49.110 --> 00:37:51.020
Spare the queen.

00:37:52.120 --> 00:37:54.990
I beg you, have mercy on the queen.

00:37:59.060 --> 00:38:00.120
Father.

00:38:05.330 --> 00:38:07.530
Did you sleep in the Detective Department?

00:38:07.530 --> 00:38:11.140
Yes. This is a big deal, I have a lot of work to do.

00:38:11.740 --> 00:38:15.440
Everything in the case indicates
at me as if I were a criminal.

00:38:16.110 --> 00:38:18.240
But you didn't talk about it.

00:38:19.040 --> 00:38:20.310
Don't worry.

00:38:21.150 --> 00:38:23.550
The detective department took up the investigation.

00:38:23.550 --> 00:38:25.220
If you have been slandered,

00:38:25.580 --> 00:38:27.990
I will reveal the real culprit of this incident.

00:38:28.620 --> 00:38:30.020
It's calming.

00:38:31.720 --> 00:38:33.160
Recently

00:38:33.460 --> 00:38:37.200
you said you made up your mind
on the scale of your dreams.

00:38:38.460 --> 00:38:41.000
So how big is your dream?

00:38:43.270 --> 00:38:44.870
My dream is

00:38:46.340 --> 00:38:48.940
become at least half as successful as you are.

00:38:55.380 --> 00:38:57.580
It's already late. Rest.

00:39:20.910 --> 00:39:21.970
Don't come near.

00:39:22.510 --> 00:39:24.040
If you follow me, I will kill myself.

00:39:28.650 --> 00:39:29.680
Soyeon.

00:39:41.590 --> 00:39:46.460
I know what motivates you.

00:40:14.830 --> 00:40:18.060
So where is the queen early in the morning?

00:40:18.300 --> 00:40:19.830
She's in the royal kitchen.

00:40:20.330 --> 00:40:21.430
Now.

00:40:22.600 --> 00:40:23.600
Nothing.

00:40:24.340 --> 00:40:27.200
I wanted her to cook
I'll have breakfast when he wakes up.

00:40:27.470 --> 00:40:30.210
And she’s already cooking for her grandma, that’s how it is.

00:40:51.500 --> 00:40:52.700
That scared me.

00:40:52.930 --> 00:40:55.670
It's early after all. What are you cooking?

00:40:55.900 --> 00:40:58.500
I've been so depressed lately.
And I can’t sleep.

00:40:58.670 --> 00:41:00.640
It's like I'm saying my morning prayer,

00:41:00.640 --> 00:41:02.270
I make a very annoying dish,

00:41:02.270 --> 00:41:04.610
which needs to be crushed
and stir a million times.

00:41:05.680 --> 00:41:08.110
But the rice porridge looks a little strange.

00:41:08.110 --> 00:41:10.920
This is not rice porridge. This is potage.

00:41:11.280 --> 00:41:12.850
Are you tongue-tied? It's still early.

00:41:12.850 --> 00:41:15.150
It means "carrot porridge."

00:41:15.420 --> 00:41:18.220
Wait a minute, I need to write this down.

00:41:19.790 --> 00:41:20.930
And how to do it?

00:41:21.030 --> 00:41:25.260
You need to chop the onions and carrots
and cook for an hour in water.

00:41:25.260 --> 00:41:26.930
Then grind in a mortar.

00:41:26.930 --> 00:41:29.230
It's like you're crushing everything
experiences and illusions.

00:41:29.770 --> 00:41:33.470
Then stir over low heat
so that it does not burn and there are no clots.

00:41:33.470 --> 00:41:35.140
With a sense of self-improvement.

00:41:35.910 --> 00:41:38.110
Season with salt

00:41:40.140 --> 00:41:41.980
and add a little milk.

00:41:41.980 --> 00:41:43.410
Even milk?

00:41:43.510 --> 00:41:45.020
That's all?

00:41:45.220 --> 00:41:46.320
No.

00:41:46.780 --> 00:41:50.820
You need to prepare vegetable soup in advance.

00:41:51.190 --> 00:41:52.590
Take the broth

00:41:53.560 --> 00:41:56.530
and add a little to the porridge
for a rich taste.

00:41:56.660 --> 00:41:59.160
You need to be so confused
just to add a little?

00:41:59.160 --> 00:42:02.100
I told you so. It's like morning prayer.

00:42:04.900 --> 00:42:07.140
You put your heart and soul into it.

00:42:07.140 --> 00:42:10.740
I'm sure the king will come to his senses right away,
as soon as he tries.

00:42:11.840 --> 00:42:12.880
This is not for him.

00:42:16.010 --> 00:42:18.880
What to suffer twice, I’ll figure it out in one fell swoop.

00:42:19.250 --> 00:42:21.690
Because I said something to her last time

00:42:21.720 --> 00:42:25.360
makes me eat with my mother-in-law?

00:42:26.190 --> 00:42:30.090
She dared her wayward
say with my mouth that I'm old,

00:42:30.360 --> 00:42:32.260
Should I look at her first thing in the morning?

00:42:38.640 --> 00:42:40.270
What is this?

00:42:40.270 --> 00:42:41.840
This is brunch.

00:42:42.410 --> 00:42:43.810
Brunch?

00:42:43.970 --> 00:42:46.140
Means "women meet together."

00:42:46.380 --> 00:42:48.550
This is the time when women gather for breakfast

00:42:48.550 --> 00:42:50.650
and get closer to each other.

00:42:50.950 --> 00:42:53.750
Everyone knows what it is.

00:42:53.750 --> 00:42:55.520
It's like you're not from Gojoseon.

00:42:55.590 --> 00:42:56.690
Asshole.

00:42:57.860 --> 00:43:00.790
I used to do this often at home.

00:43:01.190 --> 00:43:02.460
It was a long time ago.

00:43:03.360 --> 00:43:04.630
Asshole.

00:43:07.470 --> 00:43:09.570
This is carrot porridge.

00:43:09.830 --> 00:43:12.370
It contains many products that
will help improve vision.

00:43:12.370 --> 00:43:13.440
Yes?

00:43:14.140 --> 00:43:15.810
Queen Mother, eat more.

00:43:15.810 --> 00:43:18.180
It seems like you've become blind lately.

00:43:18.180 --> 00:43:22.210
If that’s the case, then I think the queen should eat everything.

00:43:23.450 --> 00:43:25.080
What the? Why are they so cocky?

00:43:33.460 --> 00:43:34.890
Very tasty.

00:43:41.230 --> 00:43:42.730
Edible.

00:43:44.170 --> 00:43:45.700
From now on

00:43:45.700 --> 00:43:48.240
I will make sure that
we got together more often.

00:43:48.240 --> 00:43:50.410
-Scoundrel.
-What a bastard.

00:43:50.470 --> 00:43:52.480
Then I apologize.

00:43:54.610 --> 00:43:56.280
I'll bring you some drinks.

00:44:05.160 --> 00:44:09.530
Rumors about culinary skills
queens are a bit exaggerated.

00:44:09.830 --> 00:44:12.930
The ability to recognize good food -
this is a component of nobility.

00:44:13.530 --> 00:44:18.100
You're letting the queen get away with everything
just for this talent?

00:44:18.100 --> 00:44:21.010
Since it was you who conveyed to me the queen's words,

00:44:21.570 --> 00:44:23.270
I can't believe it.

00:44:24.680 --> 00:44:28.750
Of course you won't believe what I say.

00:44:29.050 --> 00:44:31.720
I heard the king and queen

00:44:32.420 --> 00:44:35.220
They secretly exchanged notes all night.

00:44:35.620 --> 00:44:39.090
I wonder what they wrote to each other?

00:44:40.890 --> 00:44:43.860
I'll bring your drinks.

00:44:52.770 --> 00:44:54.510
It is a drink made from wine and various fruits,

00:44:54.510 --> 00:44:57.680
boiled with anise and cinnamon.

00:44:58.580 --> 00:45:00.380
Wine first thing in the morning?

00:45:00.410 --> 00:45:02.010
All the alcohol has evaporated

00:45:02.010 --> 00:45:04.850
the only products left are those
help maintain youth.

00:45:05.450 --> 00:45:09.020
It's more of a medicine than a drink.

00:45:16.990 --> 00:45:19.130
I can't believe you thought of making wine.

00:45:19.600 --> 00:45:22.500
How did you come up with this idea?

00:45:22.830 --> 00:45:27.070
Where do you get inspiration for your dishes?

00:45:27.070 --> 00:45:31.380
I don't know what to call it
inspiration or creation.

00:45:31.380 --> 00:45:34.450
When I see the ingredients, I immediately think:

00:45:34.450 --> 00:45:36.010
how to preserve their original taste.

00:45:36.450 --> 00:45:38.880
During these times, they were wary of the West,

00:45:38.880 --> 00:45:40.650
so I won’t say that this is French cuisine.

00:45:46.920 --> 00:45:47.930
Madam.

00:45:53.900 --> 00:45:55.430
Hello sir.

00:45:56.900 --> 00:45:59.740
I've been waiting to talk to you.

00:45:59.740 --> 00:46:02.740
What? What do you want to talk about?

00:46:02.740 --> 00:46:05.010
After the incident with the king

00:46:05.740 --> 00:46:07.540
I was overcome by different thoughts.

00:46:09.150 --> 00:46:11.320
Nobody knows what will happen next

00:46:11.880 --> 00:46:14.750
and tomorrow may be the last.

00:46:14.950 --> 00:46:18.120
If my life ends tomorrow,

00:46:19.360 --> 00:46:21.630
What will I regret most?

00:46:21.890 --> 00:46:25.130
About feelings that I couldn't express

00:46:25.700 --> 00:46:27.160
because I doubted it.

00:46:27.530 --> 00:46:28.870
One sincere word

00:46:29.370 --> 00:46:31.500
better than any sophisticated confession.

00:46:33.700 --> 00:46:34.870
Therefore

00:46:37.810 --> 00:46:39.310
I want to tell you

00:46:40.610 --> 00:46:41.750
that I love you.

00:46:51.490 --> 00:46:53.060
I don't like you.

00:46:53.490 --> 00:46:54.530
What?

00:46:55.590 --> 00:46:56.790
About gunpowder.

00:46:57.390 --> 00:46:59.500
Amount of gunpowder produced in the south

00:46:59.500 --> 00:47:00.760
Gyeongsangdo Province,

00:47:01.100 --> 00:47:03.730
and the quantity arriving at the warehouse vary.

00:47:05.170 --> 00:47:06.470
I knew it.

00:47:12.110 --> 00:47:13.940
Is the king still unconscious?

00:47:14.480 --> 00:47:15.550
Yes.

00:47:16.210 --> 00:47:19.320
I heard he lost his hearing. This will be a problem in the future.

00:47:22.950 --> 00:47:25.120
About this incident with the king.

00:47:25.720 --> 00:47:27.830
For an explosion of this magnitude

00:47:29.160 --> 00:47:30.830
did you use gunpowder?

00:47:31.760 --> 00:47:32.830
I'm not sure.

00:47:33.260 --> 00:47:36.930
It could be sulfur or explosive gas.

00:47:37.630 --> 00:47:39.570
If it were sulfur, there would be a smell,

00:47:39.570 --> 00:47:41.510
so the king would have noticed him.

00:47:41.610 --> 00:47:43.610
If it were gas it would be difficult

00:47:43.610 --> 00:47:46.180
prevent it from leaking and explode all at once.

00:47:46.280 --> 00:47:48.950
The culprits are interrogated, but they do not confess.

00:47:48.950 --> 00:47:50.480
It's difficult to know who is behind this.

00:48:21.750 --> 00:48:24.720
When I see the ingredients, I immediately think:

00:48:24.720 --> 00:48:26.550
how to preserve their original taste.

00:48:29.790 --> 00:48:31.220
Can't be.

00:48:31.720 --> 00:48:33.820
Guilty of treason

00:48:33.820 --> 00:48:35.890
have the leader been revealed?

00:48:36.690 --> 00:48:39.960
Looks like low ranking guards
opposing the Royal Court,

00:48:39.960 --> 00:48:41.930
got together and caused an explosion.

00:48:41.970 --> 00:48:43.070
Is it true?

00:48:43.630 --> 00:48:46.970
You say no one is behind them?

00:48:47.700 --> 00:48:50.410
In something as big as the murder of a king?

00:48:50.410 --> 00:48:51.780
This is impossible.

00:48:52.380 --> 00:48:55.480
The ones we have to fear most are those who have nothing to lose.

00:48:55.480 --> 00:48:57.710
They probably thought
that they can't rise higher,

00:48:57.710 --> 00:48:59.980
so we decided to radically change the situation.

00:48:59.980 --> 00:49:01.690
This is probably the reason.

00:49:02.820 --> 00:49:05.790
It makes sense. Act of treason for the purpose of enthronement

00:49:05.790 --> 00:49:08.890
the king's half-brother, Lee Wong-gyeong,

00:49:08.890 --> 00:49:11.360
also committed by low-ranking guards.

00:49:12.360 --> 00:49:14.200
Considering that the king is unconscious,

00:49:14.200 --> 00:49:16.730
The longer we delay this, the more confusion there will be.

00:49:16.830 --> 00:49:17.970
Therefore

00:49:18.340 --> 00:49:21.240
the seven culprits will take full responsibility

00:49:23.410 --> 00:49:26.110
and will be sentenced to death.

00:49:34.450 --> 00:49:37.720
For attempting to assassinate the king
and conspiracy to commit treason

00:49:39.190 --> 00:49:40.960
you are sentenced to death.

00:49:42.560 --> 00:49:44.530
Do you have the last word?

00:49:49.700 --> 00:49:51.970
If you sentence them to death,

00:49:52.340 --> 00:49:55.370
you will never know who was behind all this.

00:49:55.870 --> 00:49:58.080
They said that no one was behind this.

00:49:58.910 --> 00:50:00.240
This is a rash decision...

00:50:00.240 --> 00:50:03.650
This decision was made after a night of investigation.

00:51:02.840 --> 00:51:03.910
Beheaded.

00:51:05.840 --> 00:51:06.840
Stop.

00:51:14.220 --> 00:51:16.650
The investigation was carried out
by royal order.

00:51:17.220 --> 00:51:18.920
Are you going to interrupt us?

00:51:19.120 --> 00:51:21.390
Release the innocent immediately.

00:51:23.430 --> 00:51:25.030
This is a real order.

00:51:35.840 --> 00:51:36.970
Sorry I'm late.

00:51:37.670 --> 00:51:38.710
You...

00:51:41.780 --> 00:51:45.980
I heard you were unconscious.

00:51:46.320 --> 00:51:48.990
I'm young and full of strength

00:51:49.350 --> 00:51:50.990
so I recovered quickly.

00:51:55.230 --> 00:51:57.490
I didn't want to lie in vain

00:51:57.490 --> 00:51:59.530
and recover in bed.

00:51:59.760 --> 00:52:01.130
So I looked for those

00:52:01.130 --> 00:52:03.830
who plotted to kill me.

00:52:04.300 --> 00:52:08.070
First I found out about you.

00:52:08.640 --> 00:52:12.640
Are you saying you checked us?

00:52:13.210 --> 00:52:15.280
Someone is plotting treason.

00:52:16.250 --> 00:52:18.320
Say that your personal life is more important

00:52:19.380 --> 00:52:23.450
what is the life of a king?

00:52:24.390 --> 00:52:26.490
No, that's not true.

00:52:28.330 --> 00:52:31.160
If you have nothing to hide, then there is nothing to be afraid of.

00:52:35.000 --> 00:52:36.330
Don't worry.

00:52:37.500 --> 00:52:39.700
I found the leader.

00:52:40.940 --> 00:52:42.570
-What is he talking about?
-What's happening?

00:52:48.010 --> 00:52:50.510
In the bakhurnitsa used in the ceremony,

00:52:51.110 --> 00:52:53.550
Gunpowder was found in large quantities.

00:52:53.820 --> 00:52:56.390
-Powder?
-Powder?

00:52:59.260 --> 00:53:00.320
Large quantity?

00:53:06.160 --> 00:53:08.630
Bahurnitsa will become a huge bomb.

00:53:09.030 --> 00:53:11.670
-It's too dangerous.
-Everything has already been decided.

00:53:12.100 --> 00:53:14.040
Tracing the origins of gunpowder,

00:53:14.670 --> 00:53:16.310
I received information

00:53:16.310 --> 00:53:19.880
what is this gunpowder
trade unofficially at the port of Tonne.

00:53:26.050 --> 00:53:29.250
By the way, why do you need so much gunpowder?

00:53:29.450 --> 00:53:33.220
To attack Joseon again a little later.

00:53:36.860 --> 00:53:38.130
Thank you.

00:53:38.930 --> 00:53:40.730
-Thank you?
-Thank you.

00:53:42.530 --> 00:53:44.730
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

00:53:45.570 --> 00:53:47.870
Thank you.

00:53:48.540 --> 00:53:51.210
Where did this gunpowder come from?

00:53:51.540 --> 00:53:53.410
It is produced only for military purposes.

00:53:53.410 --> 00:53:56.180
It cannot in any way be produced for personal use,

00:53:56.550 --> 00:53:58.680
After all, this is a dangerous and valuable commodity.

00:54:00.220 --> 00:54:04.290
So, I looked at all the places where gunpowder is made in Joseon.

00:54:04.960 --> 00:54:06.720
And I discovered something strange.

00:54:08.330 --> 00:54:10.860
In certain areas at production sites

00:54:10.860 --> 00:54:15.230
They constantly pocketed some amount of gunpowder.

00:54:17.570 --> 00:54:19.640
The amount of concealed gunpowder

00:54:19.640 --> 00:54:23.410
It was small at first, but grew over time.

00:54:23.770 --> 00:54:24.840
Straight

00:54:26.080 --> 00:54:28.040
how greed grows.

00:54:29.350 --> 00:54:31.280
-What?
-This is true?

00:54:31.580 --> 00:54:35.250
Do you know when the gunpowder theft began?

00:54:36.020 --> 00:54:37.550
troop commander Kim Jwageun?

00:54:42.560 --> 00:54:46.230
In the same year that I ascended the throne.

00:54:47.930 --> 00:54:52.100
In the same year, Mr. Kim Jwageun became the commander of the troops.

00:54:53.700 --> 00:54:56.040
Your Majesty, this is a false accusation.

00:54:56.040 --> 00:54:57.440
Be silent!

00:54:58.240 --> 00:55:01.010
The Minister of War, responsible for the production of gunpowder,

00:55:01.010 --> 00:55:04.450
also a traitor who plotted treason with Kim Jwageun!

00:55:05.580 --> 00:55:08.050
I'm using the royal guard's fake identities as bait.

00:55:08.320 --> 00:55:12.090
Kim Jwageun should have found out about this by now.

00:55:17.560 --> 00:55:19.930
You will go through unbearable torture,

00:55:20.330 --> 00:55:21.630
but bear with them.

00:55:23.670 --> 00:55:25.140
I will definitely save you.

00:55:30.640 --> 00:55:35.250
This is a false accusation
understand this, Your Majesty!

00:55:38.950 --> 00:55:41.580
If you say again that you are being falsely accused,

00:55:43.020 --> 00:55:45.420
I will immediately give you poison to drink.

00:55:49.960 --> 00:55:51.960
Gunpowder merchants sold it

00:55:51.960 --> 00:55:54.030
anyone who paid.

00:55:54.230 --> 00:55:56.970
Bandits, even the Japanese!

00:55:57.170 --> 00:56:00.240
If this is not for the sake of destroying Joseon, then for what?

00:56:01.200 --> 00:56:04.110
Who else was here with them?

00:56:15.390 --> 00:56:17.250
Troop commander Kim Jwageun.

00:56:17.790 --> 00:56:20.090
Minister of War Kim Chang-hyuk.

00:56:21.420 --> 00:56:22.690
These two

00:56:23.990 --> 00:56:27.060
stole national weapons to weaken the army,

00:56:27.630 --> 00:56:31.770
and planned an assassination attempt on me, the king,

00:56:34.500 --> 00:56:35.910
which means they are guilty of treason.

00:56:36.670 --> 00:56:39.880
What should we call this operation?

00:56:41.980 --> 00:56:42.980
Phoenix.

00:56:45.720 --> 00:56:47.280
Operation name -

00:56:48.420 --> 00:56:50.420
burning phoenix.

00:56:55.430 --> 00:56:57.330
For all the crimes

00:56:58.930 --> 00:57:01.000
those responsible will be dismissed from office

00:57:02.530 --> 00:57:04.000
and exiled.

00:57:05.970 --> 00:57:07.040
Your Majesty.

00:57:11.270 --> 00:57:14.110
-The Dowager Queen.
-The Dowager Queen.

00:57:14.540 --> 00:57:16.510
What are you doing?

00:57:16.980 --> 00:57:18.720
Why do you judge without reason?

00:57:19.150 --> 00:57:21.820
You must have lost your mind after the explosion.

00:57:22.420 --> 00:57:25.050
Remember the boundaries of what is permitted!

00:57:25.720 --> 00:57:26.920
Is that so?

00:57:28.630 --> 00:57:30.360
If you say so

00:57:37.600 --> 00:57:42.310
You must have lost your mind due to old age.

00:57:43.670 --> 00:57:48.550
I cannot continue discussing political issues while you are in this state.

00:57:49.610 --> 00:57:52.920
Please leave your regency.

00:57:55.050 --> 00:57:56.390
-What?
-What is he talking about?

00:57:58.860 --> 00:58:02.860
It's time for me to make my own decisions.

00:58:03.430 --> 00:58:04.590
Your Majesty!

00:58:04.590 --> 00:58:07.700
I should have given Kim Jwageun the poison to drink immediately

00:58:07.700 --> 00:58:09.500
and execute his entire family.

00:58:09.730 --> 00:58:12.270
But because of you and the queen

00:58:13.040 --> 00:58:15.310
I decided to just strip him of his title.

00:58:16.670 --> 00:58:17.840
Don't you like it?

00:58:18.310 --> 00:58:22.750
Are you trying to make a deal with me in exchange for my brother's life?

00:58:23.250 --> 00:58:26.620
You can only call it a deal if you have a choice.

00:58:30.320 --> 00:58:31.390
Your Majesty.

00:58:33.960 --> 00:58:37.090
I, Kim Jwageun, have been falsely accused

00:58:37.330 --> 00:58:38.730
but I will prove my loyalty,

00:58:38.730 --> 00:58:41.130
obeying the royal order.

00:58:41.600 --> 00:58:42.930
What a relief.

00:58:43.570 --> 00:58:46.770
I was afraid that because you are old, you might be consumed by greed.

00:58:46.970 --> 00:58:48.840
I'm not against being removed from office.

00:58:49.070 --> 00:58:51.340
But I ask you to give me the opportunity

00:58:51.340 --> 00:58:53.810
clear your name.

00:58:54.110 --> 00:58:56.610
I ask Sakhonbu to be removed from his position.

00:58:58.010 --> 00:58:59.080
I accept your request.

00:58:59.380 --> 00:59:04.020
But if Sakhonbu does not remove him from office by tomorrow,

00:59:04.350 --> 00:59:07.990
I will immediately remove the commander of the troops, Kim Jwageun, from his position.

00:59:08.560 --> 00:59:11.330
and I will dissolve not only Sakhonbu himself,

00:59:11.330 --> 00:59:14.730
but also all the officials present!

00:59:15.400 --> 00:59:19.900
-We ask for your mercy!
-We ask for your mercy!

00:59:36.720 --> 00:59:38.320
You have lost.

00:59:38.720 --> 00:59:41.690
You were kicked out by the king to whom you yourself gave the throne!

00:59:42.090 --> 00:59:45.190
I didn't know that the king would plan his own assassination attempt.

00:59:45.800 --> 00:59:48.730
Who do you think set the trap?

00:59:50.270 --> 00:59:52.740
I entrusted you with the selection of noblewomen.

00:59:53.100 --> 00:59:55.570
But you don't understand people well.

00:59:57.870 --> 01:00:01.710
Confucius said that the heart is more complex than nature,

01:00:01.810 --> 01:00:04.650
and seeing someone else's heart is more difficult than seeing what is behind the clouds.

01:00:05.210 --> 01:00:06.580
I made a mistake in the selection of noblewomen

01:00:06.580 --> 01:00:08.720
both in the palace and outside it.

01:00:09.890 --> 01:00:12.760
You also trusted the queen

01:00:12.760 --> 01:00:15.160
take care of the selection of royal concubines.

01:00:15.760 --> 01:00:18.430
But she made a choice in favor of the king.

01:00:18.660 --> 01:00:20.930
And it was the queen who saved the feast,

01:00:20.930 --> 01:00:22.400
that I ruined it.

01:00:23.930 --> 01:00:27.340
The enemy is terrible when he is among his own.

01:00:40.050 --> 01:00:41.120
Your Highness.

01:00:48.360 --> 01:00:51.090
His Majesty must have regained consciousness.

01:00:53.460 --> 01:00:57.100
I can keep an eye on my husband
when he regains consciousness.

01:00:57.770 --> 01:01:00.940
If he doesn't wake up, I'll be useless.

01:01:01.500 --> 01:01:04.270
If I become useless, I will be overthrown.

01:01:04.270 --> 01:01:06.780
If I'm overthrown, I'll give up thoughts of revenge

01:01:06.780 --> 01:01:09.250
and open a restaurant to earn a living.

01:01:10.780 --> 01:01:12.580
Not too bad.

01:01:13.020 --> 01:01:14.050
Queen!

01:01:15.250 --> 01:01:18.320
His Majesty...

01:01:21.520 --> 01:01:23.260
He regained consciousness.

01:01:23.860 --> 01:01:25.030
Is it true?

01:01:25.030 --> 01:01:27.330
Yes. His hearing has returned

01:01:27.330 --> 01:01:29.470
and he went to the royal council.

01:01:29.470 --> 01:01:31.670
I was really scared.

01:01:32.370 --> 01:01:33.600
I have to go.

01:01:35.540 --> 01:01:36.840
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

01:01:38.940 --> 01:01:40.210
I don't have time.

01:01:45.210 --> 01:01:46.780
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

01:01:48.250 --> 01:01:49.650
I'm so glad.

01:01:51.690 --> 01:01:53.460
I'm really very happy.

01:01:59.360 --> 01:02:01.800
Don't cry. Why are you crying?

01:02:02.270 --> 01:02:03.800
It's such a relief.

01:02:03.800 --> 01:02:05.600
Court lady Choi.

01:02:09.170 --> 01:02:11.940
-I'll do it.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

01:02:17.980 --> 01:02:19.150
Your Majesty.

01:02:24.350 --> 01:02:25.820
Everything is fine now.

01:02:26.760 --> 01:02:29.790
Everything is fine because you are awake and healthy.

01:02:31.490 --> 01:02:35.570
I will never lose you again.

01:02:37.530 --> 01:02:38.570
Hwajin.

01:02:41.470 --> 01:02:43.010
Queen's Dictionary

01:02:50.250 --> 01:02:51.350
Your Majesty.

01:02:51.350 --> 01:02:54.420
They said that you would visit the king. Why are you sitting here?

01:02:54.980 --> 01:02:56.220
Another glass.

01:02:56.690 --> 01:02:59.920
It’s somehow awkward to see him sober.

01:03:01.020 --> 01:03:05.030
Stop drinking. You shouldn't do this, Your Majesty.

01:03:05.030 --> 01:03:07.660
You've had enough work. Go home!

01:03:11.070 --> 01:03:13.370
I'll drink this to you.

01:03:15.440 --> 01:03:16.940
Court lady Choi.

01:03:17.840 --> 01:03:19.280
Court lady Choi.

01:03:23.650 --> 01:03:26.150
There is an unlimited supply of alcohol in the royal kitchen.

01:03:29.120 --> 01:03:31.150
Why are you embarrassed?

01:03:33.460 --> 01:03:35.590
It's awkward because...

01:03:38.290 --> 01:03:40.930
You're right. Why is this awkward?

01:03:42.130 --> 01:03:44.400
I'm confident in myself! Let's go to the king.

01:03:44.670 --> 01:03:46.840
You can't go now

01:03:46.840 --> 01:03:48.500
go when you sober up.

01:03:49.570 --> 01:03:50.870
Fine. Let's go tomorrow.

01:03:51.210 --> 01:03:52.440
Let's put this off until tomorrow.

01:03:52.440 --> 01:03:53.640
Just like going on a diet.

01:03:53.880 --> 01:03:55.810
We have tomorrow!

01:03:56.350 --> 01:03:58.650
Royal chef. Another bottle.

01:03:59.550 --> 01:04:01.920
Does she think she came to the tavern or what?

01:04:03.750 --> 01:04:04.790
Faster.

01:04:41.960 --> 01:04:43.090
Court lady Kan.

01:04:46.730 --> 01:04:48.900
Secret

01:04:48.900 --> 01:04:50.000
Your Majesty!

01:04:54.500 --> 01:04:55.540
Your Majesty.

01:05:15.760 --> 01:05:18.230
This was found in the Daejojeon Hall.

01:05:18.230 --> 01:05:21.360
As expected, the king and queen work together.

01:05:21.360 --> 01:05:24.370
The Queen is completely broken.

01:05:25.330 --> 01:05:28.870
Broken things need to be replaced with new ones.

01:05:29.810 --> 01:05:34.210
But you can make a broken thing last until the end

01:05:35.780 --> 01:05:37.910
and send it to the fire.

01:05:39.580 --> 01:05:42.350
Maybe we use real arsenic?

01:05:49.760 --> 01:05:52.360
The Queen loves to eat so much.

01:05:52.960 --> 01:05:55.460
So let's set the table for her.

01:05:56.730 --> 01:05:59.340
Are you going to leave the king?

01:05:59.700 --> 01:06:03.510
We have to break it
to continue to use it.

01:06:03.970 --> 01:06:08.540
If this happens as soon as he
will give his heart to the queen, he will understand

01:06:09.110 --> 01:06:11.680
that everyone on his side will become unhappy.

01:06:58.060 --> 01:07:00.560
Isn't it a miracle

01:07:02.230 --> 01:07:04.500
that tomorrow comes every day?

01:07:11.910 --> 01:07:14.140
Let's go to the second round in the Songjeongjong Hall.

01:07:14.510 --> 01:07:17.980
The king's recovery must be celebrated.

01:07:17.980 --> 01:07:20.780
Please don't shout, Your Majesty.

01:07:20.780 --> 01:07:22.420
Your Majesty!

01:07:22.920 --> 01:07:24.650
Your Majesty!

01:07:24.650 --> 01:07:27.720
You can't call him that.

01:07:29.460 --> 01:07:30.660
Open.

01:07:34.360 --> 01:07:35.560
Open.

01:07:42.340 --> 01:07:45.270
Potatoes "Spiral"

01:07:49.480 --> 01:07:53.280
Are you sleeping?

01:08:13.840 --> 01:08:15.810
I think I fell asleep.

01:08:22.040 --> 01:08:24.450
Have you been looking out for me?

01:08:26.520 --> 01:08:28.920
Why do you always do this?

01:08:30.120 --> 01:08:34.120
You worry about me, you try to understand me.

01:08:36.030 --> 01:08:39.860
Come to think of it, you were the first person I saw when I came here.

01:08:44.130 --> 01:08:46.770
I owe you so much.

01:08:48.200 --> 01:08:50.940
I thought about you when I tried to leave the palace.

01:08:52.540 --> 01:08:54.680
Thought I'd never see you again.

01:09:34.350 --> 01:09:36.220
Hong Young.

01:09:58.210 --> 01:09:59.640
Are you awake?

01:10:28.970 --> 01:10:31.140
I am sure that the soul of this woman has taken possession of my body.

01:10:31.140 --> 01:10:33.140
Why do you always avoid me?

01:10:33.140 --> 01:10:35.210
-Wait.
-What did he want to ask me?

01:10:35.210 --> 01:10:36.250
Did you like it?

01:10:36.250 --> 01:10:38.150
Didn't she say that this is prohibited?

01:10:38.150 --> 01:10:40.220
She said that hugging, smiling and lying next to you -

01:10:40.220 --> 01:10:41.880
all this is prohibited.

01:10:42.250 --> 01:10:44.020
I forbid you to say that this is prohibited.

01:10:44.390 --> 01:10:45.750
I've prepared everything.

01:10:45.750 --> 01:10:46.860
What do you see?

01:10:46.860 --> 01:10:49.260
Someone will die in the palace today.

01:10:49.260 --> 01:10:50.730
I can't believe they tried to get rid of the queen.

01:10:50.730 --> 01:10:55.260
I specially prepared ice, which today is more valuable than gold.

01:10:55.260 --> 01:10:56.870
-Your Majesty.
-My queen.
